        "Description": "After making a bad joke at the AL-GHAZAL Family dinner and ordering the wrong Pizza for his Cousin, his Relative BOERT AL-GHAZALI has Issued a Hit on Omar and everyone at his Party invloved in Fast Food. Boert has asked for the owners of DBD-Diners,  HENRY &quot;EYKEE&quot; NIGEL and ROY &quot;THE BALD BITCH&quot; ALBERT to be drowned in the Toilet in response to seeing a Restroom in one of their Diners.  He`s  also ordered for MUKARRAM FAYAD, new Owner of Pizza Hut to be blown up for his Sins. Omar is to be Shot.",
